Yes, the scissor box affects `gl.clear()`, but only when the scissor test is enabled. The page doesn't state this directly. It appears in the general description and in a code comment.

**Exact sentence about which operations are affected:**
> "When the scissor test is enabled, only pixels within the scissor box can be modified by drawing commands."

**Exact code comment in the example:**
